  "description": "The processing run for subject **sub-001** will use FreeSurfer version\u202f6.0.1 with full parallel execution on **8\u202fCPUs**. The recon\u2011all command is invoked with the options \u201c**-all -qcache -hippo-subfields**\u201d, and both hippocampal sub\u2011field segmentation and brain\u2011stem structure extraction are enabled. Surface registration, as well as conversion of surfaces, volumes, and statistical outputs, are all turned on. The required FreeSurfer license string \u201c**ABCDE-12345-XYZ**\u201d and the accompanying license file named **license.txt** have been provided.\n\nAccess to the processing platform is authenticated with the API key **my-secret-api-key-9876**. The primary anatomical image is a NIfTI file **sub-001_T1w.nii.gz**, and five additional T1\u2011weighted NIfTI volumes are supplied as **sub-001_T1w_2.nii.gz**, **sub-001_T1w_3.nii.gz**, **sub-001_T1w_4.nii.gz**, and **sub-001_T1w_5.nii.gz**. A T2\u2011weighted NIfTI image **sub-001_T2w.nii.gz** is also included for the session."
